[I] Wayfire Config Manager

[T] Wayfire Config Manager is a Gtk3 application to configure wayfire. It
[T] writes the config file that wayfire reads to update option values.

[U] https://wayfire.org/

[A] Iliya Bozhinov
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/x11

[E] opt wf-shell
[E] opt wdisplays

[L] MIT
[V] 0.11.0

[D] 2b312e961525e887ea1c2fdf6fa35db3dceb2b6eb0f299949a6658e0 wcm-0.11.0.tar.gz git+https://github.com/WayfireWM/wcm.git v0.11.0

pkginstalled wf-shell || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dwf_shell=disabled
